cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "HPV Nanopore Analysis Pipeline (shared cluster, CPU-only)"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end, CPU-only reconstruction of HPV whole genomes from Oxford Nanopore
  tiling-amplicon reads for 12 high-risk types (HPV 16/18/31/33/35/39/45/52/56/58/59/66).
  Performs ingest, read QC, amplicon-aware length filtering, co-infection-aware type
  assignment, per-type consensus via ARTIC minion + Clair3 (with two-run origin-junction
  handling), coverage QC and publication figures. Validated end-to-end on the real
  ARTIC 1.10.1 + Clair3 2.0.1 path and verified for all-users cluster deployment under a
  non-admin account. Consumes the scheme v5 bundle from the hpv-primer-design project.
type: software
